* {{audio|en-us-backstroke.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[swimming]] [[stroke]] swum lying on one's [[back]], while rotating both [[arm]]s through the water as to [[propel]] the swimmer [[backwards]].
# {{lb|en|bellringing}} The [[pull]] on the [[tail]] of the [[rope]] that swings the [[bell]] through a full circle (compare [[handstroke]])

